      "creator": null,
      "note": "Airbnb ([@airbnb](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/8kue0m6zzuohq79zmao/95azhnhld58r7v/aHR0cDovL3R3aXR0ZXIuY29tL0BhaXJibmI=)) is partnering with hosts to connect 100,000 healthcare workers and first responders with places to stay that are close to their patients. Huge kudos to the entire Airbnb team for taking such swift and amazing action. I have donated, and you can help by donating or hosting. [More details here](https://el2.fourhourmail.com/c/8kue0m6zzuohq79zmao/99bzhnhld58r7m/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYWlyYm5iLmNvbS9vcGVuaG9tZXMvY292aWQxOXJlbGllZg==).",
